-**Match the model to the job.** Start from the role's line or default, keep its family, and set the level the job needs. The `/setup-pstack` budget sets each role's starting level. Panel seats keep their listed level. Raise any other role one step, up to xhigh, for the hardest or subtlest work, lower it one step for judgment, and two or more steps for routine work. No role runs above xhigh. Opus 5.5 always runs its `-fast` slug. Verification always runs on the `swarm workers` model, `opus-high` by default. A Gemini seat never runs above `sonnet-high`, its top slug. If the Agent tool rejects a slug, never pass it again. Fall back to the role's line or default, then the calling skill's fallback, then the closest valid slug of the same family, then omit `model`. Say so.
